/runtime/

# Build outputs
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dll
!bin/**/*.dll

# OS files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# AI 编码工具本地配置（ZCode 自动生成，规则同步自本文件；各机自生成即可，不进仓库）
.zcodeignore

# Misc
*.bak
*.orig

# 内部开发文档（不推送仓库）
/MIGRATION.md
docs/QUEST-*.md
docs/TASK*.md
docs/FEATURE-*.md
docs/*-PRD.md
docs/PROGRESS.md
/PROGRESS.md
docs/fc-sync-test-archive/

# WorkBuddy 本地数据（默认全忽略；开发记忆例外，规则见 AGENTS.md「三、开发记忆」）
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/memory/
.workbuddy/memory/*
!.workbuddy/memory/*.md
.workbuddy/memory/MEMORY.backup-*.md

# WorkBuddy 发布应用内部标记
*.genie
